# Ideas: the tab, the idea hex found something on, its earlier checks, Start it and Undo, Stop
# looking, a word added to it, Back, then the list shown in full and scrolled to its end. The
# stand-in keeps every write from reaching hex.
launch /
tap hex-tab-ideas
shoot ideas
tap idea-row-t-906
shoot idea
tap idea-earlier
shoot earlier
tap idea-start
shoot started
tap idea-start-undo
shoot undone
tap idea-look
shoot stopped
type idea-field Brass, not copper
shoot typed
tap idea-send
wait 1
shoot sent
tap chrome-back
shoot back
tap ideas-more
scroll home-list-ideas
shoot ideas-end
scroll-back home-list-ideas
shoot ideas-top
